# Only admin/ and public/ (plus the two root files they need) ever get
# built into the image. Everything else in the repo — mobile apps,
# Supabase project, docs, git history, secrets — has no business inside
# a container that just serves the PHP portal and the public dashboard.
*

!admin/
!admin/**
!public/
!public/**
!index.php
!.htaccess

# Never bake real secrets into an image layer even by accident — Render
# env vars supply these at runtime instead (see config.php's env()).
.env
.env.*
